  aciklama:
  - "\xC7i\xE7eklerle ho\u015F ge\xE7in,\nBal\u0131 incitme g\xF6n\xFCl.\nBir k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
    meyve i\xE7in\nDal\u0131 incitme g\xF6n\xFCl.\n\nKonu\u015Fmak bize mahsus,\nOlsa
    da bir g\xFCzel s\xFCs,\nYa \"hay\u0131r\" de, yahut sus,\nDili incitme g\xF6n\xFCl.\n\nSevmekten
    geri kalma,\nYapan ol, y\u0131kan olma,\nSevene diken olma,\nG\xFCl\xFC incitme
    g\xF6n\xFCl.\n\nBa\u015F\u0131n olsa da y\xFCksek,\nG\xF6z\xFCn enginde gerek,\nKibirle
    y\xFCr\xFCyerek\nYolu incitme g\xF6n\xFCl\n\nMevl\xE2 verince azma,\nGeri al\u0131nca
    k\u0131zma,\nT\xFCten oca\u011F\u0131 bozma,\nK\xFCl\xFC incitme g\xF6n\xFCl.\n\nDokunur
    gayretine,\nKar\u0131\u015Fma hikmetine.\nSahibi h\xFCrmetine,\nKulu incitme
    g\xF6n\xFCl.\n\nBestami Yazgan"
